text:
I reviewed SKILL.md, both bundled files, evals.json, and verified the eval ground truths against the two fixtures (they were present, so I checked them: AUROC 0.8887 / 0.4825, cut 0.506 → 111 answered, 106 correct, 55.5% coverage — all exact).

```json
