      "finding": "Two checklist items cover one act. Step 0 already requires the locator, n, date range, sampling method and labeller - which is exactly section 0 - and step 3 then re-titles that as its own step and produces section 0 again. Step 3's real content is the sizing argument, but neither its title, its checklist line, nor its produce says so, and no expectation grades the sizing.",
