    },
    {
      "level": "INSTANCE",
      "where": "SKILL.md 'Important' section and steps 7-8; references/uncertainty-signal-evidence.md 'How to read a verdict'",
      "finding": "No host-repo path, product or talent name appears outside 'In this repo' - that section is clean and self-labelled. But the host build process leaks into the portable body and the reference: 'four runs with no skill loaded', 'no baseline run', 'this build', 'the package this skill was built from', 'The coordinator who assembled the package'. In another project these sentences name machinery the reader does not have, which is the same portability problem in prose form rather than in a path.",
